  "title": "Daktronics Introduces All Sport Pro for Fixed-Digit Scoreboards",
  "summary": "Daktronics (NASDAQ-DAKT) of Brookings, South Dakota, announces the expanded capabilities of All Sport Pro to include integration with fixed-digit scoreboards. Previously, All Sport consoles were the go-to option for control of non-video scoreboards, but this expansion of All Sport Pro levels the playing field for scoreboard control.",
